  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Proficiency with Demolitionist's Toolkit</em></p><p>You are a master at making things explode. You gain the following benefits:</p><ul><li><p>Increase your Dexterity score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p></li><li><p>When you use or arm an explosive, you may add your proficiency bonus to all saving throw DCs of that explosive.</p></li><li><p>You gain the ability to quickly craft effective explosives. If you have a Demolitionist's Toolkit on hand during a short or long rest, you may craft one explosive up to a maximum tier of half your proficiency bonus (rounded down) by spending one hour crafting. This explosive is makeshift and will not work 24 hours after being completed, and this explosive cannot be sold.</p></li></ul>",
